sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor User
participant Web
participant API
participant Service
participant DB
participant Chain
User->>Web: Start Loan Approval Sequence
Web->>API: Send authenticated request
API->>Service: Validate authorization and business rules
Service->>DB: Read or persist operational record
DB-->>Service: Return result
Service->>Chain: Submit or retrieve selected loan event
Chain-->>Service: Return status and transaction reference
Service-->>API: Return operation and chain status
API-->>Web: Return safe response
Web-->>User: Display result and next action
